Roberta Flack performs her 1973 #1 hit *Killing Me Softly With HIs Song* from her album _Killing Me Softly_ "Killing Me Softly With His Song" earned Roberta Flack the GRAMMY for Record of The Year in 1974. 🎧 Listen to more Roberta Flack here: https://Atlantic75.lnk.to/RiS7BQTF

